# multivibrator: the two-transistor astable multivibrator (circuits/multivibrator.toml),
# Manhattan style on a ground-plane tile (decision C24): the tile is the core,
# a post a net; planned by search (cp:b_uild).
circuit multivibrator
core T1 manhattan-tile
net VCC T1.5 T1.10 R1.1 R2.1 R3.1 R4.1 BT1.1
net LED1 T1.2 R1.2 D1.1
net C1N T1.3 D1.2 Q1.3 C1.1
net B2 T1.4 C1.2 R2.2 Q2.2
net LED2 T1.7 R4.2 D2.1
net C2N T1.8 D2.2 Q2.3 C2.1
net B1 T1.9 C2.2 R3.2 Q1.2
net GND T1.1 T1.6 Q1.1 Q2.1 BT1.2
